  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "odJFCrnl2edlBDdz1C5Ja",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 858.0000000000001,
      "height": 725.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1629526406,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1730483679,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793600000000,
      "created": 1793600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deployment System (rollout + health check + self-healing)\n\nFunctional requirements\n- roll out a new version (image + config) in batches, view progress\n- health check & self-healing: restart / replace unhealthy instances,\n  move instances off failed nodes\n- auto rollback on bad metrics; manual pause / resume / rollback\nOut of scope: CI build, config center, DB schema migration\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- safety: available capacity >= 75% during rollout, limited blast radius\n- static stability: data plane keeps running if control plane is down\n- convergence: detect failure < 30s, replace < 2 min\n- scale: 10k nodes, 100k instances, 1k services, 100s of rollouts\n- CAP: desired state strongly consistent, reported state eventually consistent\n\nEstimation\n- heartbeat: 10k nodes / 10s ~ 1k QPS -> lease separate from status\n- image: 1GB x 1000 nodes ~ 1TB -> regional cache / P2P, pre-pull\n\nCore entities\n- Service / Release(Version) / Rollout / Node / Instance\n\nAPI\nPOST /services/{id}/rollouts {version, strategy, autoRollback} -> rollout_id\nGET /rollouts/{id}\nPOST /rollouts/{id}/pause | resume | rollback\n(agent) WATCH /nodes/{id}/assignments\n(agent) PUT /nodes/{id}/lease, PUT /nodes/{id}/status",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deployment System (rollout + health check + self-healing)\n\nFunctional requirements\n- roll out a new version (image + config) in batches, view progress\n- health check & self-healing: restart / replace unhealthy instances,\n  move instances off failed nodes\n- auto rollback on bad metrics; manual pause / resume / rollback\nOut of scope: CI build, config center, DB schema migration\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- safety: available capacity >= 75% during rollout, limited blast radius\n- static stability: data plane keeps running if control plane is down\n- convergence: detect failure < 30s, replace < 2 min\n- scale: 10k nodes, 100k instances, 1k services, 100s of rollouts\n- CAP: desired state strongly consistent, reported state eventually consistent\n\nEstimation\n- heartbeat: 10k nodes / 10s ~ 1k QPS -> lease separate from status\n- image: 1GB x 1000 nodes ~ 1TB -> regional cache / P2P, pre-pull\n\nCore entities\n- Service / Release(Version) / Rollout / Node / Instance\n\nAPI\nPOST /services/{id}/rollouts {version, strategy, autoRollback} -> rollout_id\nGET /rollouts/{id}\nPOST /rollouts/{id}/pause | resume | rollback\n(agent) WATCH /nodes/{id}/assignments\n(agent) PUT /nodes/{id}/lease, PUT /nodes/{id}/status",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
