      "updated": 1793600000000,
      "created": 1793600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rollout Controller\n- maxSurge / maxUnavailable, minReadySeconds\n- waves: canary -> 1 AZ -> 1 region -> all, bake time\n- gate on error rate / P99 vs old version\n- rollback = reverse rollout\n\nNode Controller\n- lease timeout -> NotReady -> evict after grace -> recreate\n- many nodes lost at once -> slow down / stop eviction\n\nProbes (run by agent)\n- startup: protects slow start\n- liveness: fail -> restart\n- readiness: fail -> remove from LB (no shared deps)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rollout Controller\n- maxSurge / maxUnavailable, minReadySeconds\n- waves: canary -> 1 AZ -> 1 region -> all, bake time\n- gate on error rate / P99 vs old version\n- rollback = reverse rollout\n\nNode Controller\n- lease timeout -> NotReady -> evict after grace -> recreate\n- many nodes lost at once -> slow down / stop eviction\n\nProbes (run by agent)\n- startup: protects slow start\n- liveness: fail -> restart\n- readiness: fail -> remove from LB (no shared deps)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jsCYUlYbHp6VHWVnD8dPC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 950,
